# Hot map lookup and assignment

Measures repeated lookup and indexed replacement in one dynamic map. The
workload keeps the key set small, updates one existing key, and prints only
the final value so process output does not dominate the timed run.

>>> checkpoint map-implementation-baseline d74f693 map implementation baseline
The baseline is the first committed native map implementation.

>>> source
let values = {
    "total": 0,
    "step": 1,
    "unused": 0
}

for (iteration in 0..1000000) {
    values["total"] = values["total"] + values["step"]
}

print(values["total"])
